    m_Localized: AGILITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128391
    m_Localized: RESIST.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128392
    m_Localized: IMPACT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128393
    m_Localized: More damage with your punches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128394
    m_Localized: More damage with your kicks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128395
    m_Localized: 'Faster moves: shorter start-up and recovery.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128396
    m_Localized: You take less damage and get staggered less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128397
    m_Localized: Your hits stagger and push the rival further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128398
    m_Localized: COMBO x3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128399
    m_Localized: COMBO x4
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128400
    m_Localized: Score only
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128401
    m_Localized: Extra life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128402
    m_Localized: +1 Special
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128403
    m_Localized: '{0} in a row'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128404
    m_Localized: '{0} in a row: Power'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128405
    m_Localized: 'Builds: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128406
    m_Localized: Adds score. It does not change any fight attribute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128407
    m_Localized: +1 extra life, saved with your progress (at most {0} per song).
      After losing a fight, a life lets you fight again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128408
    m_Localized: "+1 Special for the next fight. The Special move spends it on its
      powered version (\xD7{0} damage); without one it is a plain heavy punch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128409
    m_Localized: '{0} musical bonuses in a row (within {1} s) give an x3 charge for
      the fight. Its use in the fight is still pending.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128410
    m_Localized: "{0} musical bonuses in a row (within {1} s) give an x4 charge.
      In the fight, hold \u2193 + Punch + Kick for {2} s: Power state for {3} s (\xD7{4}
      damage)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128411
    m_Localized: Musical bonuses prepare your fighter. How well you collect them
      (out of those the song has) sets your total power, up to {0} points; which
      ones you collect decides how those points are shared between the attributes.
      If a song has none of an attribute's bonuses, that attribute takes your average
      performance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15185400538128412
    m_Localized: BONUSES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
