    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15280335929008130
    m_Localized: 'Spends no charge: "triple" is the three presses, not the runner''s
      Combo x3.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15280335929008131
    m_Localized: "3rd hit \xD7{0} \xB7 free"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15280335929008132
    m_Localized: "spends 1 Special \xB7 you have {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15280335929008133
    m_Localized: "hold {0} s \xB7 spends 1 x4 \xB7 you have {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15297490770780160
    m_Localized: "With an x3 charge the third hit deals \xD7{0} damage and spends
      it; without one it is a normal hit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15297490825306112
    m_Localized: "spends 1 x3 \xB7 3rd hit \xD7{0} \xB7 you have {1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15297490825306113
    m_Localized: "hold {0} s \xB7 spends all x4 ({1}) \u2192 {2} s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15297490825306114
    m_Localized: "Hold for {0} s. Spends ALL your x4 charges (you have {1}): {2}
      s with one, +{3} s for each extra one (now {4} s). \xD7{5} damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15297490825306115
    m_Localized: "{0} musical bonuses in a row (within {1} s) give an x3 charge.
      In the fight, the Triple punch or the Triple kick spends one: its third hit
      deals \xD7{2} damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15297490825306116
    m_Localized: "{0} musical bonuses in a row (within {1} s) give an x4 charge.
      In the fight, hold \u2193 + Punch + Kick for {2} s: Power state (\xD7{3} damage),
      spending every x4 you have \u2014 {4} s with one, +{5} s for each extra one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15315109997502464
    m_Localized: You move faster, and your attacks start and recover sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331067985920
    m_Localized: Stronger kicks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620736
    m_Localized: Stronger punches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620737
    m_Localized: Move faster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620738
    m_Localized: Take less damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620739
    m_Localized: Improves every attribute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620740
    m_Localized: More powerful punches and kicks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620741
    m_Localized: 'Each one you collect adds: {0}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620742
    m_Localized: "Musical bonuses prepare your fighter: every one you collect adds
      points to the attributes it feeds \u2014 nothing is shared out or taken away.
      With no bonuses an attribute stays at its low base ({0}); it can reach {1}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620743
    m_Localized: You move faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620744
    m_Localized: Your punches deal more damage and hit harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620745
    m_Localized: Your kicks deal more damage and hit harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15349331189620746
    m_Localized: Power {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15474758939893760
    m_Localized: 'You move faster and every move comes out sooner: you get there
      first, and can guard or dodge before they hit you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15474759002808320
    m_Localized: "Spends 1 Special (you have {0}): a projectile that always takes
      {1}% of the rival's health. Guard can't stop it \u2014 only a dodge. Without
      a Special: a plain heavy punch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15474759002808321
    m_Localized: "spends 1 Special \xB7 {1}% of the rival's health \xB7 you have
      {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15474759002808322
    m_Localized: "+1 Special for the next fight. The Special move spends it: a projectile
      that always takes {0}% of the rival's health \u2014 guard can't stop it, a
      dodge can. The rival's Special does the same to you. Without one it is a plain
      heavy punch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
